"""Failure taxonomy: 12 failure classes x 25 root causes, each with log/diff/metric signatures,
runbook text, regression tests and postmortem phrasing.

PROTOCOL (kept honest): `dev` log phrasings and every regex in `SIGNATURES` were written first. `held` phrasings
(different wording of the same failures) are used for the held-out benchmark split and were NOT used to tune any
signature. The synthetic data generator (`synth.py`) renders these templates; all of it is LABELLED SYNTHETIC.
"""
